    "id": "numbers-pronunciation",
    "title": "Numbers on the radio",
    "shortExplanation": "Say each digit separately and use 'decimal' in frequencies. 'Niner' is used for 9.",
    "example": "One two one decimal niner",
    "whyItMatters": "Digit-by-digit transmission prevents mistakes with similar-sounding numbers."
  },
